            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In an embodiment a vehicle includes a boom (2) having a first opening (6) at a first surface (4) and a second opening (7) at an opposite second surface (5), a channel (8) extending in a first direction between the first and second openings (6, 7) and connecting the first opening with the second opening and a heat exchanger (20) arranged in the channel (8), wherein the heat exchanger is tilted with respect to the first direction.</p>
